   318→<body>
   319→<div class="container">
   320→    <a class="back-link" href="index.html">← Back to Tools</a>
   321→    <h1>RSA Private Key Parser</h1>
   322→    <p class="subtitle">Parse PEM format RSA private keys and view components</p>
